Package: farsight-client
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: x11vnc, xvfb, xterm, dbus-daemon, python3-websockify, novnc, iproute2, systemd, curl, ca-certificates
Maintainer: Farsight <massimo.bernava@gmail.com>
Description: Farsight remote access & telemetry client
 Installs and manages the Tailscale-bound x11vnc + websockify/noVNC remote
 desktop stack and the farsight-agent telemetry publisher. x11vnc attaches
 to whatever's on X11_DISPLAY: an existing desktop session if there is one,
 otherwise a virtual display (Xvfb) this package starts itself. Requires
 Tailscale to already be installed and reachable (see install.sh, which
 handles that before this package installs) — not pulled in via Depends:
 since it's not in Ubuntu's own repos.
